		"adizes.title": "Your style by Adizes: {code}",
		"adizes.legend": "P — results, A — order, E — change, I — people. A capital letter is a strength, a small one is some, a dash is none.",
		"adizes.boss.P": "Irina herself is a P: she wanted results.",
